    <bpmn:process id="W_W4057" name="W4057. Process Discovery &amp; End-to-End Process Mapping" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: New improvement project; unmapped process; annual architecture refresh
Frequency: Per project + on demand
Volume: Per targeted end-to-end process (e.g., P2P, O2C, store-replenishment, returns)
Owner: OpEx Process Lead (Green/Black Belt)
Participants: Process participants (frontline), process owner, OpEx CoE
Source: workflow W4057 — Process Discovery &amp; End-to-End Process Mapping</bpmn:documentation>
