      <bpmn:userTask id="W4057_Task4" name="OpEx conduct process discovery: interviews, observation (gemba walk at…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: OpEx conduct process discovery: interviews, observation (gemba walk at store/DC), and document the as-is end-to-end flow with handoffs, systems, cycle times, and pain points
Responsible (R): OpEx Process Lead / Participants
Accountable (A): OpEx Process Lead
Duration: Per project</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4057_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4057_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4057_Task5" name="OpEx author the SIPOC and current-state value-stream map (process, flow…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: OpEx author the SIPOC and current-state value-stream map (process, flow, inventory, info, time) against the architecture (W4050)
Responsible (R): OpEx Process Lead
Accountable (A): Process Owner
Duration: Per project</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4057_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4057_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4057_Task6" name="OpEx validate the map with participants and the owner, and baseline against…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: OpEx validate the map with participants and the owner, and baseline against KPIs (W4054)
Responsible (R): OpEx Process Lead / Owner
Accountable (A): Process Owner
Duration: Per project</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4057_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4057_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W4057_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
