    <bpmn:process id="W_W4058" name="W4058. Process Mining &amp; Task Mining from ERP/System Event Logs" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Improvement project; performance anomaly; periodic health check
Frequency: Per project + continuous monitoring for key processes
Volume: High-volume processes: POS (2.8M txn/mo links to VS-08), P2P (~9,500 invoices/mo links to VS-15), store replenishment (~5,000/mo links to VS-02), returns (links to VS-32), ecommerce orders (~42,900/mo links to VS-10)
Owner: OpEx Data Lead / BI (links to VS-28)
Participants: OpEx CoE, BI/Data Engineering (links to VS-28.2), IT (links to VS-27), process owners
Source: workflow W4058 — Process Mining &amp; Task Mining from ERP/System Event Logs</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4058_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4058_Lane1" name="OpEx Data Lead">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4058_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4058_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4058_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4058_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4058_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4058_Start3" name="Improvement project; performance anomaly; periodic health check">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4058_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4058_Task4" name="OpEx/BI ingest event logs from ERP/POS/WMS/ecommerce and run process mining to…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: OpEx/BI ingest event logs from ERP/POS/WMS/ecommerce and run process mining to discover the *actual* process (variants, frequencies, deviations from standard) and task mining for desktop-based work
Responsible (R): OpEx Data Lead / BI
Accountable (A): COO
Duration: Per project</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4058_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4058_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4058_Task5" name="OpEx quantify process friction: throughput, bottlenecks, rework loops, wait…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: OpEx quantify process friction: throughput, bottlenecks, rework loops, wait times, automation candidates, and compliance deviations (e.g., bypassed approvals)
Responsible (R): OpEx Data Lead
Accountable (A): Process Owner
Duration: Per project</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4058_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4058_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4058_Task6" name="OpEx publish the mined view, reconcile with the as-is map (W4057), and feed…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: OpEx publish the mined view, reconcile with the as-is map (W4057), and feed findings to the pipeline (W4052) and continuous monitoring dashboard (W4066)
Responsible (R): OpEx Data Lead / BI
Accountable (A): COO
Duration: Per project</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4058_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4058_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W4058_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
