        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-630 (ensure controlled execution — Process Mining, Process Analysis &amp; Improvement Project Execution (PA-133.2).) | - CTL-630: task-mining scoped with HR/Labor Relations; aggregated/role-level reporting; data minimization
Owner: OpEx Data Lead / BI (links to VS-28)</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
