Responsible (R): OpEx Process Lead / BI
Accountable (A): Process Owner
Duration: Per project</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4061_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4061_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
