    <bpmn:process id="W_W4064" name="W4064. Improvement Rollout, Change Management &amp; Sustainment" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Pilot go-decision (W4061)
Frequency: Per project
Volume: Per improvement project (often network-wide: 200 stores / 4 DCs)
Owner: OpEx Process Lead / OCM Lead (links to VS-134)
